{
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "Field_intro",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_intro"
      },
      "text": "## Approve the settlement run\n\nRun **{{settlementRunId}}** pays the producers for the payments of **{{periodStart}}** to **{{periodEnd}}**.\n\nThe run total is over the approval limit of £10,000 (draft rule DR2). A second person must approve the run before any money leaves the network. Check the totals against the payment and settlement records (DS3)."
    },
    {
      "id": "Table_producerSettlements",
      "type": "table",
      "label": "Amount for each producer",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_table"
      },
      "rowCount": 10,
      "dataSource": "=for s in producerSettlements return {producer: s.producerName, net: {c: floor(abs(s.netAmount) * 100 + 0.5), t: (if s.netAmount < 0 then \"-\" else \"\") + string(floor(c / 100)) + \".\" + substring(string(c - floor(c / 100) * 100 + 100), 2)}.t, bankDetails: if s.bankDetailsOnFile = true then \"Yes\" else \"No\"}",
      "columns": [
        {
          "label": "Producer",
          "key": "producer"
        },
        {
          "label": "Net amount (£)",
          "key": "net"
        },
        {
          "label": "Bank details on file",
          "key": "bankDetails"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Field_total",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_total"
      },
      "text": "### Run total: £{{string(floor(floor(runTotal * 100 + 0.5) / 100)) + \".\" + substring(string(floor(runTotal * 100 + 0.5) - floor(floor(runTotal * 100 + 0.5) / 100) * 100 + 100), 2)}}"
    },
    {
      "id": "Field_runDecision",
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "runDecision",
      "label": "What do you want to do?",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_decision"
      },
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "Approve the run and pay the producers",
          "value": "APPROVE"
        },
        {
          "label": "Stop the run so that finance can correct the records",
          "value": "STOP"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Field_approvalNote",
      "type": "textarea",
      "key": "approvalNote",
      "label": "Why do you stop the run?",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_note"
      },
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=runDecision != \"STOP\""
      }
    }
  ],
  "type": "default",
  "id": "approve-settlement-run",
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.6.0",
  "schemaVersion": 16
}
